From 1cf57b550bb0305eac8b6012fde813f7323bf74c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:40:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 43/43] po: Swap left and right eyes in the languages of Sparky
 Stereo OS

The menu entry and the message for a file that cannot keep the
correction, in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese,
Korean, and Simplified and Traditional Chinese.

The translations are those of the A10 field build (vlc-stereo
3.0.24-1+stereo3d11~a10.1, 19 October 2026, by Daniel Ramos). That
build's catalogues were installed as the release tarball had them, so
they never reached its package; the packaging's update-gmo step makes
them now.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 Astra via Codex
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 po/de.po    | 10 ++++++++++
 po/fr.po    | 10 ++++++++++
 po/ja.po    | 10 ++++++++++
 po/ko.po    | 10 ++++++++++
 po/pl.po    | 10 ++++++++++
 po/pt_BR.po | 10 ++++++++++
 po/zh_CN.po | 10 ++++++++++
 po/zh_TW.po | 10 ++++++++++
 8 files changed, 80 insertions(+)

diff --git a/po/de.po b/po/de.po
index 6c9ae70..0da8293 100644
--- a/po/de.po
+++ b/po/de.po
@@ -30149,3 +30149,13 @@ msgstr ""
 "Zeigt die linke Ansicht dem rechten Auge und die rechte Ansicht dem "
 "linken Auge, für ein Video, dessen Kennzeichnung sie vertauscht "
 "angibt."
+
+#: src/video_output/vout_intf.c modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp
+msgid "Swap left and right eyes"
+msgstr "Linkes und rechtes Auge vertauschen"
+
+#: src/video_output/vout_intf.c
+msgid ""
+"Eye order could not be saved for this file; the correction applies to "
+"this playback only."
+msgstr "Die Augenreihenfolge konnte für diese Datei nicht gespeichert werden; die Korrektur gilt nur für diese Wiedergabe."
